{"seq":11,"trial_id":"gbrain-ladder-2026-10/hermes-haiku-gbrain-semantic-told-mu-heldout/sd-06-pod-end-of-day/r4","wall_ts":"2026-10-25T05:27:09.323Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"715c23ea35fd675020b5ac47f540053da935c0ebb2cf5448e5ae5d521006a185","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"@june.osei-lark: I've set up a recurring 'Pod end of day' note for #strategic-pod, weekdays at 17:30 Chicago time. It lists that day's new messages in this channel. Today's 17:30 run couldn't be scheduled because that time has already passed on the scheduler's clock, so the first note will be the next weekday's. The scheduler isn't running yet, so nothing will post until the Hermes gateway is started. Its fixed UTC time will also be an hour off from 17:30 once US daylight saving ends on 1 November."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000127"}}
{"seq":12,"trial_id":"gbrain-ladder-2026-10/hermes-haiku-gbrain-semantic-told-mu-heldout/sd-06-pod-end-of-day/r4","wall_ts":"2026-10-25T05:27:13.482Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"735747c4ff58f52b33da6063fe776095e1876c2f3aaeee872f3aeb507b51f8b6","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"@june.osei-lark Correction to my last message: today's run was not skipped because 17:30 had passed. It is 09:00 Chicago time here. The one-time run I tried for today failed because my scheduler works in real time, and that time was already past on it. The recurring job is set for 22:30 UTC on weekdays, which is 17:30 Chicago time until daylight saving ends on 1 November. The scheduler is not running yet, so no note will post until the Hermes gateway is started."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000128"}}
{"seq":13,"trial_id":"gbrain-ladder-2026-10/hermes-haiku-gbrain-semantic-told-mu-heldout/sd-06-pod-end-of-day/r4","wall_ts":"2026-10-25T05:27:16.789Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"cb935f24eca05795a2becafc7e4c6047d2d7cd3ea9b47551e73b2366553267d4","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Set up, but it won't post until the Hermes gateway is running.\n\n- **Schedule:** Weekdays at 22:30 UTC, which is 17:30 Chicago time until daylight saving ends on 1 November. After that, the job needs to move to 23:30 UTC. Job ID: 3db3286cde9b.\n- **Today:** The one-time run for today could not be scheduled, because the scheduler's clock is already past 17:30 Chicago time. Today's note will not post.\n- **Posts in #strategic-pod:** I posted two messages replying to June. The first gave the wrong reason for today's run, and the second corrects it. Both are visible to the channel.\n- **Still to do:** Start the gateway (`hermes gateway install` / `hermes gateway start`), and change the job's time after 1 November."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000129"}}
